Tests understanding of memory ordering, visibility, and simple rendezvous in a beginner-friendly but realistic context.

## Key Concepts
- C11 atomics, memory_order_release/acquire
- Visibility guarantees and simple spin-wait vs condvar
- Data races and safe initialization sequencing

